    {
      "section_id": "sec-0001",
      "title": "用法用量总则",
      "heading_path": [
        "中药饮片安全用药示例手册",
        "用法用量总则"
      ],
      "content_type": "NARRATIVE_RULE",
      "block_ids": [
        "cf8cc3d4937a3f1740fd282bcf385d4c"
      ],
      "block_count": 1,
      "char_count": 62,
      "table_count": 0,
      "page_start": null,
      "page_end": null,
      "sample_text": "## 用法用量总则\n中药饮片的剂量应当遵循药典规定，毒性饮片严禁超量使用。\n特殊人群如儿童、老年人、肝肾功能不全者应当慎用。"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "sec-0002",
      "title": "十八反",
      "heading_path": [
        "中药饮片安全用药示例手册",
        "十八反"
      ],
      "content_type": "RELATION_GROUP",
      "block_ids": [
        "529ad19c84d13cc47a0cd68dc31e9bb3"
      ],
      "block_count": 1,
      "char_count": 41,
      "table_count": 0,
      "page_start": null,
      "page_end": null,
      "sample_text": "## 十八反\n甘草反甘遂、大戟、海藻、芫花。\n乌头反贝母、瓜蒌、半夏、白蔹、白及。"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "sec-0003",
      "title": "妊娠禁用",
      "heading_path": [
        "中药饮片安全用药示例手册",
        "妊娠禁用"
      ],
      "content_type": "ENTITY_GROUP_LIST",
      "block_ids": [
        "6d845ae91b3ce82e705aec83f2bf6f43"
      ],
      "block_count": 1,
      "char_count": 47,
      "table_count": 0,
      "page_start": null,
      "page_end": null,
      "sample_text": "## 妊娠禁用\n孕妇禁用：巴豆、牵牛子、斑蝥、麝香、三棱、莪术。\n孕妇慎用：桃仁、红花、牛膝。"
    },
